window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b287-1bbb5155e04bc1d8.json"]={sha256:"1bbb5155e04bc1d8b9b6d055a9f3a8b16b813b3f26d305e413babfd4cfd3d525",value:{"id":"b287","title":"港池航道疏浚","titleEn":"Harbor-basin and navigation-channel dredging","category":"water","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"以測深方量泥漿輸送與環境收支管理港池航道疏浚。課程從邊界辨識與資料整理走到水理量化、構造介面及驗證紀錄；每一步把計算結果連回可量測的證據。十個不同單元分別處理關鍵機制，不以名義尺寸或單一通過率代替整體工程判斷，並明列合成算例與現地資料的差別。","summaryEn":"Manage harbor dredging through sounding, volume, slurry transport and environmental accounting. The course moves from boundary identification and evidence to hydraulic quantification, structural interfaces and verification records. Ten distinct units connect each calculated quantity to measurable evidence. Nominal geometry or a single pass rate does not establish whole-system performance, and synthetic teaching examples remain separate from field observations.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"water-coasts","subcategoryTitle":"海岸、港灣與水資源韌性","subcategoryTitleEn":"Coasts, ports and water-resource resilience","learningTrack":"water","learningSubdiscipline":"water-coasts","learningTags":["water","water-coasts","water"],"architectureFamily":"water-coast","architectureNodes":[["疏浚稜體與斷面","Dredging prism and sections"],["乾固體生產率","Dry-solid production rate"],["泵送能量收支","Pumping energy balance"],["測深不確定度預算","Sounding uncertainty budget"],["回流水固體平衡","Return-water solids balance"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[4,1]],"diagram":{"type":"water-coast","labels":["疏浚稜體與斷面","乾固體生產率","泵送能量收支","測深不確定度預算","回流水固體平衡"],"labelsEn":["Dredging prism and sections","Dry-solid production rate","Pumping energy balance","Sounding uncertainty budget","Return-water solids balance"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"以下為原創合成算例，不是地標工程的實測或推薦操作值。教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設相鄰斷面挖方面積120與180m²、間距50m，V=(120+180)×50/2=7500m³；限線性面積變化。假設第二斷面面積由180增10%至198m²，其餘不變，方量由7500增至7950m³，只增加6%；不是任何航道加深都按同一百分比變化。重新計算前先列固定條件、單位、適用尺度及可能失效的邊界。把模型敏感度與測量誤差分開，不能將單一參數變化直接當成工程風險或壽命比例。比較兩次結果後，記錄還需要哪些獨立證據，並由負責專業人員判斷適用性。","textEn":"This original synthetic example is neither a landmark measurement nor a recommended operating value. Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume excavation areas120 and180m² separated by50m. V=(120+180)×50/2=7500m³, assuming linear area variation. Increasing the second section area from180 to198m² by10% with everything else fixed raises volume from7500 to7950m³, only6%; this is not a universal channel-deepening response. Before recalculating, list fixed conditions, units, applicable scale and boundaries that could fail. Separate model sensitivity from measurement uncertainty: a parameter change does not directly give a proportional change in engineering risk or service life. Compare the results, record independent evidence still needed, and have the responsible specialist determine applicability.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":15,"enrichmentVersion":15,"stages":[{"id":"b287-v15-s1","title":"水文條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Hydrology, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「疏浚稜體與斷面」與「泥漿密度與濃度」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Dredging prism and sections\" and \"Slurry density and concentration\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b287-v15-01","title":"疏浚稜體與斷面：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Dredging prism and sections: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「疏浚稜體與斷面」如何影響港池航道疏浚的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Dredging prism and sections” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Harbor-basin and navigation-channel dredging”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"航道挖方由既有海床和目標稜體之差形成，邊坡與局部淺點不能用單一平均深度取代。相鄰斷面梯形積分只在面積沿程近似線性時合理，曲率大時應加密；計量還須區分設計挖方、允許超挖及實際移除量，避免讓合約分類混入物理收支。 假設相鄰斷面挖方面積120與180m²、間距50m，V=(120+180)×50/2=7500m³；限線性面積變化。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「疏浚稜體與斷面」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Excavation is the difference between surveyed bed and a defined dredging prism; side slopes and local shoals cannot be replaced by one mean depth. Trapezoidal integration assumes approximately linear area variation between sections and needs refinement where curvature is large. Design volume, permitted overdepth and actual removal remain distinct quantities in the physical balance. Assume excavation areas120 and180m² separated by50m. V=(120+180)×50/2=7500m³, assuming linear area variation. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Dredging prism and sections” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「航道平均深度達標就代表每個局部淺點都已移除。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Meeting average channel depth proves that every local controlling shoal has been removed.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「疏浚稜體與斷面」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Dredging prism and sections”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-01-k1","title":"疏浚稜體與斷面","titleEn":"Dredging prism and sections","text":"航道挖方由既有海床和目標稜體之差形成，邊坡與局部淺點不能用單一平均深度取代。相鄰斷面梯形積分只在面積沿程近似線性時合理，曲率大時應加密；計量還須區分設計挖方、允許超挖及實際移除量，避免讓合約分類混入物理收支。","textEn":"Excavation is the difference between surveyed bed and a defined dredging prism; side slopes and local shoals cannot be replaced by one mean depth. Trapezoidal integration assumes approximately linear area variation between sections and needs refinement where curvature is large.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：航道平均深度達標就代表每個局部淺點都已移除。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Meeting average channel depth proves that every local controlling shoal has been removed. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「疏浚稜體與斷面」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Dredging prism and sections\" is correct?","options":["航道平均深度達標就代表每個局部淺點都已移除。","航道挖方由既有海床和目標稜體之差形成，邊坡與局部淺點不能用單一平均深度取代。","固體質量百分比和固體體積百分比可以不加換算直接互用。"],"optionsEn":["Meeting average channel depth proves that every local controlling shoal has been removed.","Excavation is the difference between surveyed bed and a defined dredging prism; side slopes and local shoals cannot be replaced by one mean depth.","Solid mass percentage and solid volume percentage are interchangeable without conversion."],"answer":1,"explanation":"航道挖方由既有海床和目標稜體之差形成，邊坡與局部淺點不能用單一平均深度取代。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Excavation is the difference between surveyed bed and a defined dredging prism; side slopes and local shoals cannot be replaced by one mean depth. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b287-v15-02","title":"疏浚稜體與斷面：定量估算","titleEn":"Dredging prism and sections: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「疏浚稜體與斷面」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Dredging prism and sections” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設相鄰斷面挖方面積120與180m²、間距50m，V=(120+180)×50/2=7500m³；限線性面積變化。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume excavation areas120 and180m² separated by50m. V=(120+180)×50/2=7500m³, assuming linear area variation. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：繪出原床、設計底與邊坡交線，核對各斷面是否使用同一高程。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Plot original bed, design bottom and side-slope intersections on a shared datum.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設相鄰斷面挖方面積120與180m²、間距50m，V=(120+180)×50/2=7500m³；限線性面積變化。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume excavation areas120 and180m² separated by50m. V=(120+180)×50/2=7500m³, assuming linear area variation.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「疏浚稜體與斷面」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Dredging prism and sections\", which statement holds?","options":["清水管損公式無需任何修正就能保證高濃度泥漿可輸送。","測得聲波往返距離後不必考慮探頭吃水與潮位修正。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["An uncorrected clear-water friction formula guarantees transport of concentrated dredging slurry.","Acoustic range alone gives charted bed elevation without draft or tide correction.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b287-v15-03","title":"疏浚稜體與斷面：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Dredging prism and sections: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「疏浚稜體與斷面」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Dredging prism and sections” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"繪出原床、設計底與邊坡交線，核對各斷面是否使用同一高程。加入中間剖面測試線性假設，並將超挖和不可測區獨立列帳，讓方量差能追溯到具體幾何。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Plot original bed, design bottom and side-slope intersections on a shared datum. Add an intermediate section to test linearity, and account for overdepth and unmeasured areas separately so volume differences remain traceable to explicit geometry. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：繪出原床、設計底與邊坡交線，核對各斷面是否使用同一高程。加入中間剖面測試線性假設，並將超挖和不可測區獨立列帳，讓方量差能追溯到具體幾何。","observationEn":"Site practice: Plot original bed, design bottom and side-slope intersections on a shared datum. Add an intermediate section to test linearity, and account for overdepth and unmeasured areas separately so volume differences remain traceable to explicit geometry.","failure":"注意干擾：斷面間藏有淺脊時梯形法會低估挖方，若把合約允許超挖全算成已挖則高估完成量。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A hidden ridge between sections understates excavation, while treating all permitted overdepth as completed removal overstates progress. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"繪出原床、設計底與邊坡交線，核對各斷面是否使用同一高程。加入中間剖面測試線性假設，並將超挖和不可測區獨立列帳，讓方量差能追溯到具體幾何。","textEn":"Plot original bed, design bottom and side-slope intersections on a shared datum. Add an intermediate section to test linearity, and account for overdepth and unmeasured areas separately so volume differences remain traceable to explicit geometry.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"繪出原床、設計底與邊坡交線，核對各斷面是否使用同一高程。加入中間剖面測試線性假設，並將超挖和不可測區獨立列帳，讓方量差能追溯到具體幾何。","textEn":"Plot original bed, design bottom and side-slope intersections on a shared datum. Add an intermediate section to test linearity, and account for overdepth and unmeasured areas separately so volume differences remain traceable to explicit geometry.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「疏浚稜體與斷面」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Dredging prism and sections\"?","options":["繪出原床、設計底與邊坡交線，核對各斷面是否使用同一高程。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","靜態水深大於吃水就代表任何航速與波況都可以通航。"],"optionsEn":["Plot original bed, design bottom and side-slope intersections on a shared datum.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Water depth exceeding draft permits navigation at every speed and wave condition."],"answer":0,"explanation":"繪出原床、設計底與邊坡交線，核對各斷面是否使用同一高程。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Plot original bed, design bottom and side-slope intersections on a shared datum. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b287-v15-04","title":"疏浚稜體與斷面：失效診斷","titleEn":"Dredging prism and sections: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「疏浚稜體與斷面」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Dredging prism and sections” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"斷面間藏有淺脊時梯形法會低估挖方，若把合約允許超挖全算成已挖則高估完成量。平均深度達到目標，也不能證明船舶通過路徑無淺點。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A hidden ridge between sections understates excavation, while treating all permitted overdepth as completed removal overstates progress. Adequate mean depth does not establish that the vessel route is free from controlling shallow features. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設相鄰斷面挖方面積120與180m²、間距50m，V=(120+180)×50/2=7500m³；限線性面積變化。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: V=(120+180)×50/2=7500m³, assuming linear area variation.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「航道平均深度達標就代表每個局部淺點都已移除。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Meeting average channel depth proves that every local controlling shoal has been removed.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"斷面間藏有淺脊時梯形法會低估挖方，若把合約允許超挖全算成已挖則高估完成量。平均深度達到目標，也不能證明船舶通過路徑無淺點。","textEn":"A hidden ridge between sections understates excavation, while treating all permitted overdepth as completed removal overstates progress. Adequate mean depth does not establish that the vessel route is free from controlling shallow features.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「疏浚稜體與斷面」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Dredging prism and sections\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","斷面間藏有淺脊時梯形法會低估挖方，若把合約允許超挖全算成已挖則高估完成量。","固體質量百分比和固體體積百分比可以不加換算直接互用。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","A hidden ridge between sections understates excavation, while treating all permitted overdepth as completed removal overstates progress.","Solid mass percentage and solid volume percentage are interchangeable without conversion."],"answer":1,"explanation":"斷面間藏有淺脊時梯形法會低估挖方，若把合約允許超挖全算成已挖則高估完成量。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A hidden ridge between sections understates excavation, while treating all permitted overdepth as completed removal overstates progress. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b287-v15-05","title":"泥漿密度與濃度：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Slurry density and concentration: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-04"],"objective":"說明「泥漿密度與濃度」如何影響港池航道疏浚的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Slurry density and concentration” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Harbor-basin and navigation-channel dredging”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"泥漿混合密度可在兩相體積相加假設下推回固體體積濃度，但氣泡、鹽度與粒子密度變化會破壞簡單換算。質量濃度與體積濃度不是同一比例，需先定義量測對象；濃度提高也會改變流變和輸送阻力，不能只以濃泥漿代表高效作業。 假設泥漿1300、清水1000、顆粒2650kg/m³，Cv=(1300−1000)/(2650−1000)=0.1818；忽略含氣與體積非加成。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「泥漿密度與濃度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Under additive two-phase volumes, mixture density estimates solid volume concentration. Bubbles, salinity and varying grain density violate the simple conversion. Mass and volume concentration are different fractions and require explicit definitions. Higher concentration also changes rheology and resistance, so denser slurry does not by itself demonstrate efficient or sustainable pumping performance along the entire line. Assume mixture1300, water1000 and grains2650kg/m³. Cv=(1300−1000)/(2650−1000)=0.1818, excluding air and nonadditive volume effects. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Slurry density and concentration” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「固體質量百分比和固體體積百分比可以不加換算直接互用。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Solid mass percentage and solid volume percentage are interchangeable without conversion.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「泥漿密度與濃度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Slurry density and concentration”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-05-k1","title":"泥漿密度與濃度","titleEn":"Slurry density and concentration","text":"泥漿混合密度可在兩相體積相加假設下推回固體體積濃度，但氣泡、鹽度與粒子密度變化會破壞簡單換算。質量濃度與體積濃度不是同一比例，需先定義量測對象；濃度提高也會改變流變和輸送阻力，不能只以濃泥漿代表高效作業。","textEn":"Under additive two-phase volumes, mixture density estimates solid volume concentration. Bubbles, salinity and varying grain density violate the simple conversion.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：固體質量百分比和固體體積百分比可以不加換算直接互用。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Solid mass percentage and solid volume percentage are interchangeable without conversion. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「泥漿密度與濃度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Slurry density and concentration\" is correct?","options":["固體質量百分比和固體體積百分比可以不加換算直接互用。","泥漿流量全部等於真正挖出的乾固體體積流量。","泥漿混合密度可在兩相體積相加假設下推回固體體積濃度，但氣泡、鹽度與粒子密度變化會破壞簡單換算。"],"optionsEn":["Solid mass percentage and solid volume percentage are interchangeable without conversion.","The entire slurry discharge equals the actual excavated dry-solid volume flow.","Under additive two-phase volumes, mixture density estimates solid volume concentration."],"answer":2,"explanation":"泥漿混合密度可在兩相體積相加假設下推回固體體積濃度，但氣泡、鹽度與粒子密度變化會破壞簡單換算。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Under additive two-phase volumes, mixture density estimates solid volume concentration. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b287-v15-06","title":"泥漿密度與濃度：定量估算","titleEn":"Slurry density and concentration: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「泥漿密度與濃度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Slurry density and concentration” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設泥漿1300、清水1000、顆粒2650kg/m³，Cv=(1300−1000)/(2650−1000)=0.1818；忽略含氣與體積非加成。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume mixture1300, water1000 and grains2650kg/m³. Cv=(1300−1000)/(2650−1000)=0.1818, excluding air and nonadditive volume effects. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：比較線上密度計與乾固體採樣，核對水體鹽度和代表粒子密度。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare inline density with dry-solid samples, checking salinity and representative grain density.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設泥漿1300、清水1000、顆粒2650kg/m³，Cv=(1300−1000)/(2650−1000)=0.1818；忽略含氣與體積非加成。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume mixture1300, water1000 and grains2650kg/m³. Cv=(1300−1000)/(2650−1000)=0.1818, excluding air and nonadditive volume effects.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「泥漿密度與濃度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Slurry density and concentration\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","泵的電力消耗增加就一定代表乾固體疏浚產量增加。","測深標準不確定度很小就表示所有航道障礙物都被找到。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Increased pump electricity consumption always means increased dry-solid dredging production.","Small sounding uncertainty proves that every channel obstruction has been detected."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b287-v15-07","title":"泥漿密度與濃度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Slurry density and concentration: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「泥漿密度與濃度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Slurry density and concentration” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"比較線上密度計與乾固體採樣，核對水體鹽度和代表粒子密度。標明每份報表用質量或體積濃度，追蹤氣泡與分層造成的偏差，不用單點讀值代表整段輸送狀態。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare inline density with dry-solid samples, checking salinity and representative grain density. Label each report by mass or volume concentration and track air or stratification biases instead of treating a single reading as the state of the full pipeline. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：比較線上密度計與乾固體採樣，核對水體鹽度和代表粒子密度。標明每份報表用質量或體積濃度，追蹤氣泡與分層造成的偏差，不用單點讀值代表整段輸送狀態。","observationEn":"Site practice: Compare inline density with dry-solid samples, checking salinity and representative grain density. Label each report by mass or volume concentration and track air or stratification biases instead of treating a single reading as the state of the full pipeline.","failure":"注意干擾：吸入空氣會降低密度卻不等於固體供應下降，分層採樣則可能錯失底部高濃度。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Entrained air lowers density without necessarily reducing solid feed, and stratified samples miss concentrated bed material. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"比較線上密度計與乾固體採樣，核對水體鹽度和代表粒子密度。標明每份報表用質量或體積濃度，追蹤氣泡與分層造成的偏差，不用單點讀值代表整段輸送狀態。","textEn":"Compare inline density with dry-solid samples, checking salinity and representative grain density. Label each report by mass or volume concentration and track air or stratification biases instead of treating a single reading as the state of the full pipeline.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"比較線上密度計與乾固體採樣，核對水體鹽度和代表粒子密度。標明每份報表用質量或體積濃度，追蹤氣泡與分層造成的偏差，不用單點讀值代表整段輸送狀態。","textEn":"Compare inline density with dry-solid samples, checking salinity and representative grain density. Label each report by mass or volume concentration and track air or stratification biases instead of treating a single reading as the state of the full pipeline.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「泥漿密度與濃度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Slurry density and concentration\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","比較線上密度計與乾固體採樣，核對水體鹽度和代表粒子密度。","每次滿艙容量乘理論班次就是已驗收的航道完成方量。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Compare inline density with dry-solid samples, checking salinity and representative grain density.","Full hopper capacity times theoretical cycles equals accepted completed channel excavation."],"answer":1,"explanation":"比較線上密度計與乾固體採樣，核對水體鹽度和代表粒子密度。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare inline density with dry-solid samples, checking salinity and representative grain density. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b287-v15-08","title":"泥漿密度與濃度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Slurry density and concentration: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「泥漿密度與濃度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Slurry density and concentration” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"吸入空氣會降低密度卻不等於固體供應下降，分層採樣則可能錯失底部高濃度。將兩種濃度百分比互換會使固體產量與負荷計算同時偏離實際。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Entrained air lowers density without necessarily reducing solid feed, and stratified samples miss concentrated bed material. Interchanging mass and volume percentages simultaneously corrupts estimates of solid production and the hydraulic burden on the system. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設泥漿1300、清水1000、顆粒2650kg/m³，Cv=(1300−1000)/(2650−1000)=0.1818；忽略含氣與體積非加成。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Cv=(1300−1000)/(2650−1000)=0.1818, excluding air and nonadditive volume effects.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「固體質量百分比和固體體積百分比可以不加換算直接互用。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Solid mass percentage and solid volume percentage are interchangeable without conversion.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"吸入空氣會降低密度卻不等於固體供應下降，分層採樣則可能錯失底部高濃度。將兩種濃度百分比互換會使固體產量與負荷計算同時偏離實際。","textEn":"Entrained air lowers density without necessarily reducing solid feed, and stratified samples miss concentrated bed material. Interchanging mass and volume percentages simultaneously corrupts estimates of solid production and the hydraulic burden on the system.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「泥漿密度與濃度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Slurry density and concentration\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","泥漿流量全部等於真正挖出的乾固體體積流量。","吸入空氣會降低密度卻不等於固體供應下降，分層採樣則可能錯失底部高濃度。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","The entire slurry discharge equals the actual excavated dry-solid volume flow.","Entrained air lowers density without necessarily reducing solid feed, and stratified samples miss concentrated bed material."],"answer":2,"explanation":"吸入空氣會降低密度卻不等於固體供應下降，分層採樣則可能錯失底部高濃度。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Entrained air lowers density without necessarily reducing solid feed, and stratified samples miss concentrated bed material. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b287-v15-s2","title":"水力機制、材料與定量模型","titleEn":"Hydraulics, materials and quantitative models","description":"本階段聚焦「乾固體生產率」與「管路摩擦水頭」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Dry-solid production rate\" and \"Pipeline friction head\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b287-v15-09","title":"乾固體生產率：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Dry-solid production rate: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-08"],"objective":"說明「乾固體生產率」如何影響港池航道疏浚的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Dry-solid production rate” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Harbor-basin and navigation-channel dredging”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"吸泥泵的總體積流量包含大量水，疏浚產量必須說明是泥漿、固體或原狀土量。沿管路濃度和流速需同步量測，平均值相乘在兩者相關變動時未必等於平均固體通量；生產紀錄也要分出停機與工作時間，不能把瞬時峰值當日產量。 假設泥漿Q=2m³/s、均勻Cv=0.15、顆粒2650kg/m³，乾固體通量ρsCvQ=795kg/s，1h為2862000kg。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「乾固體生產率」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Pump volume includes carrier water, so production must distinguish slurry, solids and in-situ sediment. Concentration and velocity require synchronized observations; multiplying separate means need not equal mean solid flux when they covary. Records must also separate downtime from pumping duration, since an instantaneous peak cannot be interpreted as achieved daily production or retained placement volume. Assume slurry Q=2m³/s,Cv=0.15 and grain density2650kg/m³. Dry-solid flux is795kg/s, giving2862000kg over1h of unchanged operation. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Dry-solid production rate” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「泥漿流量全部等於真正挖出的乾固體體積流量。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The entire slurry discharge equals the actual excavated dry-solid volume flow.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「乾固體生產率」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Dry-solid production rate”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-09-k1","title":"乾固體生產率","titleEn":"Dry-solid production rate","text":"吸泥泵的總體積流量包含大量水，疏浚產量必須說明是泥漿、固體或原狀土量。沿管路濃度和流速需同步量測，平均值相乘在兩者相關變動時未必等於平均固體通量；生產紀錄也要分出停機與工作時間，不能把瞬時峰值當日產量。","textEn":"Pump volume includes carrier water, so production must distinguish slurry, solids and in-situ sediment. Concentration and velocity require synchronized observations; multiplying separate means need not equal mean solid flux when they covary.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：泥漿流量全部等於真正挖出的乾固體體積流量。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The entire slurry discharge equals the actual excavated dry-solid volume flow. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「乾固體生產率」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Dry-solid production rate\" is correct?","options":["吸泥泵的總體積流量包含大量水，疏浚產量必須說明是泥漿、固體或原狀土量。","泥漿流量全部等於真正挖出的乾固體體積流量。","清水管損公式無需任何修正就能保證高濃度泥漿可輸送。"],"optionsEn":["Pump volume includes carrier water, so production must distinguish slurry, solids and in-situ sediment.","The entire slurry discharge equals the actual excavated dry-solid volume flow.","An uncorrected clear-water friction formula guarantees transport of concentrated dredging slurry."],"answer":0,"explanation":"吸泥泵的總體積流量包含大量水，疏浚產量必須說明是泥漿、固體或原狀土量。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Pump volume includes carrier water, so production must distinguish slurry, solids and in-situ sediment. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b287-v15-10","title":"乾固體生產率：定量估算","titleEn":"Dry-solid production rate: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「乾固體生產率」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Dry-solid production rate” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設泥漿Q=2m³/s、均勻Cv=0.15、顆粒2650kg/m³，乾固體通量ρsCvQ=795kg/s，1h為2862000kg。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume slurry Q=2m³/s,Cv=0.15 and grain density2650kg/m³. Dry-solid flux is795kg/s, giving2862000kg over1h of unchanged operation. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：使用同步的流量和濃度時間序列積分固體量，將停機資料明確保留為零產量。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Integrate synchronized discharge and concentration records, retaining downtime as zero production.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設泥漿Q=2m³/s、均勻Cv=0.15、顆粒2650kg/m³，乾固體通量ρsCvQ=795kg/s，1h為2862000kg。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume slurry Q=2m³/s,Cv=0.15 and grain density2650kg/m³. Dry-solid flux is795kg/s, giving2862000kg over1h of unchanged operation.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「乾固體生產率」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Dry-solid production rate\", which statement holds?","options":["測得聲波往返距離後不必考慮探頭吃水與潮位修正。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","靜態水深大於吃水就代表任何航速與波況都可以通航。"],"optionsEn":["Acoustic range alone gives charted bed elevation without draft or tide correction.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Water depth exceeding draft permits navigation at every speed and wave condition."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b287-v15-11","title":"乾固體生產率：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Dry-solid production rate: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「乾固體生產率」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Dry-solid production rate” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"使用同步的流量和濃度時間序列積分固體量，將停機資料明確保留為零產量。以接收端乾固體抽樣作交叉檢查，說明管內暫存和輸送延遲，避免混淆兩端同時讀值。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Integrate synchronized discharge and concentration records, retaining downtime as zero production. Cross-check receiver dry-solid samples and describe pipe storage and transit delay so readings at the two ends are not incorrectly compared at identical timestamps. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：使用同步的流量和濃度時間序列積分固體量，將停機資料明確保留為零產量。以接收端乾固體抽樣作交叉檢查，說明管內暫存和輸送延遲，避免混淆兩端同時讀值。","observationEn":"Site practice: Integrate synchronized discharge and concentration records, retaining downtime as zero production. Cross-check receiver dry-solid samples and describe pipe storage and transit delay so readings at the two ends are not incorrectly compared at identical timestamps.","failure":"注意干擾：只保留運轉時高濃度片段會高估整班產量，流量計與密度計時鐘偏移也會錯配脈動。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Selecting only high-concentration operating periods overstates shift production, and clock offsets mispair pulses. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"使用同步的流量和濃度時間序列積分固體量，將停機資料明確保留為零產量。以接收端乾固體抽樣作交叉檢查，說明管內暫存和輸送延遲，避免混淆兩端同時讀值。","textEn":"Integrate synchronized discharge and concentration records, retaining downtime as zero production. Cross-check receiver dry-solid samples and describe pipe storage and transit delay so readings at the two ends are not incorrectly compared at identical timestamps.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"使用同步的流量和濃度時間序列積分固體量，將停機資料明確保留為零產量。以接收端乾固體抽樣作交叉檢查，說明管內暫存和輸送延遲，避免混淆兩端同時讀值。","textEn":"Integrate synchronized discharge and concentration records, retaining downtime as zero production. Cross-check receiver dry-solid samples and describe pipe storage and transit delay so readings at the two ends are not incorrectly compared at identical timestamps.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「乾固體生產率」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Dry-solid production rate\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","九成九固體截留率可以自動證明回流水符合所有環境要求。","使用同步的流量和濃度時間序列積分固體量，將停機資料明確保留為零產量。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Ninety-nine-percent solid retention automatically proves that return water meets every environmental requirement.","Integrate synchronized discharge and concentration records, retaining downtime as zero production."],"answer":2,"explanation":"使用同步的流量和濃度時間序列積分固體量，將停機資料明確保留為零產量。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Integrate synchronized discharge and concentration records, retaining downtime as zero production. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b287-v15-12","title":"乾固體生產率：失效診斷","titleEn":"Dry-solid production rate: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「乾固體生產率」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Dry-solid production rate” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只保留運轉時高濃度片段會高估整班產量，流量計與密度計時鐘偏移也會錯配脈動。到達填區的固體量不符時，需查暫存和洩漏而非修改帳面密度。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Selecting only high-concentration operating periods overstates shift production, and clock offsets mispair pulses. A receiver discrepancy requires investigation of storage and leakage rather than arbitrary adjustment of the density used in the accounting. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設泥漿Q=2m³/s、均勻Cv=0.15、顆粒2650kg/m³，乾固體通量ρsCvQ=795kg/s，1h為2862000kg。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Dry-solid flux is795kg/s, giving2862000kg over1h of unchanged operation.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「泥漿流量全部等於真正挖出的乾固體體積流量。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The entire slurry discharge equals the actual excavated dry-solid volume flow.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只保留運轉時高濃度片段會高估整班產量，流量計與密度計時鐘偏移也會錯配脈動。到達填區的固體量不符時，需查暫存和洩漏而非修改帳面密度。","textEn":"Selecting only high-concentration operating periods overstates shift production, and clock offsets mispair pulses. A receiver discrepancy requires investigation of storage and leakage rather than arbitrary adjustment of the density used in the accounting.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「乾固體生產率」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Dry-solid production rate\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["只保留運轉時高濃度片段會高估整班產量，流量計與密度計時鐘偏移也會錯配脈動。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","清水管損公式無需任何修正就能保證高濃度泥漿可輸送。"],"optionsEn":["Selecting only high-concentration operating periods overstates shift production, and clock offsets mispair pulses.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","An uncorrected clear-water friction formula guarantees transport of concentrated dredging slurry."],"answer":0,"explanation":"只保留運轉時高濃度片段會高估整班產量，流量計與密度計時鐘偏移也會錯配脈動。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Selecting only high-concentration operating periods overstates shift production, and clock offsets mispair pulses. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b287-v15-13","title":"管路摩擦水頭：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Pipeline friction head: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-12"],"objective":"說明「管路摩擦水頭」如何影響港池航道疏浚的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Pipeline friction head” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Harbor-basin and navigation-channel dredging”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"管路阻力消耗輸送能量，長度、直徑和速度影響不同，彎頭與高程則另有貢獻。清水達西式只作基準，含砂漿體可能沉積或表現非牛頓流變，不能沿用同一摩擦係數就宣稱可輸送；要把壓力觀測和材料狀態一起比較。 假設清水基準f=0.02、L=500m、D=0.50m、v=3m/s，hf=f(L/D)v²/(2g)=9.174m；不含彎頭與漿體修正。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「管路摩擦水頭」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Pipeline resistance consumes energy, with distinct effects from length, diameter and speed; fittings and elevation add separate terms. A clear-water Darcy relation is only a baseline. Slurry can deposit or develop non-Newtonian behavior, so retaining one friction factor does not establish transportability. Pressure observations need interpretation together with concentration, grading and material condition. Assume a clear-water baseline f=0.02,L=500m,D=0.50m,v=3m/s. hf=f(L/D)v²/(2g)=9.174m, excluding fittings and slurry corrections. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Pipeline friction head” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「清水管損公式無需任何修正就能保證高濃度泥漿可輸送。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"An uncorrected clear-water friction formula guarantees transport of concentrated dredging slurry.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「管路摩擦水頭」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Pipeline friction head”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-13-k1","title":"管路摩擦水頭","titleEn":"Pipeline friction head","text":"管路阻力消耗輸送能量，長度、直徑和速度影響不同，彎頭與高程則另有貢獻。清水達西式只作基準，含砂漿體可能沉積或表現非牛頓流變，不能沿用同一摩擦係數就宣稱可輸送；要把壓力觀測和材料狀態一起比較。","textEn":"Pipeline resistance consumes energy, with distinct effects from length, diameter and speed; fittings and elevation add separate terms. A clear-water Darcy relation is only a baseline.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：清水管損公式無需任何修正就能保證高濃度泥漿可輸送。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: An uncorrected clear-water friction formula guarantees transport of concentrated dredging slurry. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「管路摩擦水頭」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pipeline friction head\" is correct?","options":["清水管損公式無需任何修正就能保證高濃度泥漿可輸送。","管路阻力消耗輸送能量，長度、直徑和速度影響不同，彎頭與高程則另有貢獻。","泵的電力消耗增加就一定代表乾固體疏浚產量增加。"],"optionsEn":["An uncorrected clear-water friction formula guarantees transport of concentrated dredging slurry.","Pipeline resistance consumes energy, with distinct effects from length, diameter and speed; fittings and elevation add separate terms.","Increased pump electricity consumption always means increased dry-solid dredging production."],"answer":1,"explanation":"管路阻力消耗輸送能量，長度、直徑和速度影響不同，彎頭與高程則另有貢獻。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Pipeline resistance consumes energy, with distinct effects from length, diameter and speed; fittings and elevation add separate terms. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b287-v15-14","title":"管路摩擦水頭：定量估算","titleEn":"Pipeline friction head: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「管路摩擦水頭」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Pipeline friction head” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設清水基準f=0.02、L=500m、D=0.50m、v=3m/s，hf=f(L/D)v²/(2g)=9.174m；不含彎頭與漿體修正。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume a clear-water baseline f=0.02,L=500m,D=0.50m,v=3m/s. hf=f(L/D)v²/(2g)=9.174m, excluding fittings and slurry corrections. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以相同高度基準畫沿管壓力線，核對壓力計位置、流速和內徑。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Plot the pressure line on a common elevation datum, checking gauge positions, velocity and internal diameter.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設清水基準f=0.02、L=500m、D=0.50m、v=3m/s，hf=f(L/D)v²/(2g)=9.174m；不含彎頭與漿體修正。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume a clear-water baseline f=0.02,L=500m,D=0.50m,v=3m/s. hf=f(L/D)v²/(2g)=9.174m, excluding fittings and slurry corrections.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「管路摩擦水頭」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pipeline friction head\", which statement holds?","options":["測深標準不確定度很小就表示所有航道障礙物都被找到。","每次滿艙容量乘理論班次就是已驗收的航道完成方量。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["Small sounding uncertainty proves that every channel obstruction has been detected.","Full hopper capacity times theoretical cycles equals accepted completed channel excavation.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b287-v15-15","title":"管路摩擦水頭：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Pipeline friction head: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「管路摩擦水頭」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pipeline friction head” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以相同高度基準畫沿管壓力線，核對壓力計位置、流速和內徑。比較清水試運與不同濃度資料，單獨列出局部損失及升高段，找出不能由基準摩擦解釋的壓降。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Plot the pressure line on a common elevation datum, checking gauge positions, velocity and internal diameter. Compare clear-water trials with different concentrations, listing fitting losses and rising sections separately to locate pressure drops unexplained by baseline friction. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以相同高度基準畫沿管壓力線，核對壓力計位置、流速和內徑。比較清水試運與不同濃度資料，單獨列出局部損失及升高段，找出不能由基準摩擦解釋的壓降。","observationEn":"Site practice: Plot the pressure line on a common elevation datum, checking gauge positions, velocity and internal diameter. Compare clear-water trials with different concentrations, listing fitting losses and rising sections separately to locate pressure drops unexplained by baseline friction.","failure":"注意干擾：管底沉積會縮小有效截面並增大阻力，壓力升高若只被當成流量增加可能延誤堵塞辨識。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Bed deposition reduces effective area and increases resistance; interpreting rising pressure solely as increased flow can delay blockage detection. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以相同高度基準畫沿管壓力線，核對壓力計位置、流速和內徑。比較清水試運與不同濃度資料，單獨列出局部損失及升高段，找出不能由基準摩擦解釋的壓降。","textEn":"Plot the pressure line on a common elevation datum, checking gauge positions, velocity and internal diameter. Compare clear-water trials with different concentrations, listing fitting losses and rising sections separately to locate pressure drops unexplained by baseline friction.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以相同高度基準畫沿管壓力線，核對壓力計位置、流速和內徑。比較清水試運與不同濃度資料，單獨列出局部損失及升高段，找出不能由基準摩擦解釋的壓降。","textEn":"Plot the pressure line on a common elevation datum, checking gauge positions, velocity and internal diameter. Compare clear-water trials with different concentrations, listing fitting losses and rising sections separately to locate pressure drops unexplained by baseline friction.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「管路摩擦水頭」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pipeline friction head\"?","options":["以相同高度基準畫沿管壓力線，核對壓力計位置、流速和內徑。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","航道平均深度達標就代表每個局部淺點都已移除。"],"optionsEn":["Plot the pressure line on a common elevation datum, checking gauge positions, velocity and internal diameter.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Meeting average channel depth proves that every local controlling shoal has been removed."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以相同高度基準畫沿管壓力線，核對壓力計位置、流速和內徑。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Plot the pressure line on a common elevation datum, checking gauge positions, velocity and internal diameter. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b287-v15-16","title":"管路摩擦水頭：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pipeline friction head: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「管路摩擦水頭」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pipeline friction head” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"管底沉積會縮小有效截面並增大阻力，壓力升高若只被當成流量增加可能延誤堵塞辨識。老化管徑和磨耗也會使原先水力曲線不再代表實際系統。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Bed deposition reduces effective area and increases resistance; interpreting rising pressure solely as increased flow can delay blockage detection. Aging geometry and wear also make the original hydraulic curve unrepresentative of the operating pipeline. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設清水基準f=0.02、L=500m、D=0.50m、v=3m/s，hf=f(L/D)v²/(2g)=9.174m；不含彎頭與漿體修正。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Assume a clear-water baseline f=0.02,L=500m,D=0.50m,v=3m/s. hf=f(L/D)v²/(2g)=9.174m, excluding fittings and slurry corrections.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「清水管損公式無需任何修正就能保證高濃度泥漿可輸送。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An uncorrected clear-water friction formula guarantees transport of concentrated dredging slurry.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"管底沉積會縮小有效截面並增大阻力，壓力升高若只被當成流量增加可能延誤堵塞辨識。老化管徑和磨耗也會使原先水力曲線不再代表實際系統。","textEn":"Bed deposition reduces effective area and increases resistance; interpreting rising pressure solely as increased flow can delay blockage detection. Aging geometry and wear also make the original hydraulic curve unrepresentative of the operating pipeline.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「管路摩擦水頭」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pipeline friction head\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","管底沉積會縮小有效截面並增大阻力，壓力升高若只被當成流量增加可能延誤堵塞辨識。","泵的電力消耗增加就一定代表乾固體疏浚產量增加。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Bed deposition reduces effective area and increases resistance; interpreting rising pressure solely as increased flow can delay blockage detection.","Increased pump electricity consumption always means increased dry-solid dredging production."],"answer":1,"explanation":"管底沉積會縮小有效截面並增大阻力，壓力升高若只被當成流量增加可能延誤堵塞辨識。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Bed deposition reduces effective area and increases resistance; interpreting rising pressure solely as increased flow can delay blockage detection. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b287-v15-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「泵送能量收支」與「聲波測深與基準」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Pumping energy balance\" and \"Acoustic depth and datum\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b287-v15-17","title":"泵送能量收支：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Pumping energy balance: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-16"],"objective":"說明「泵送能量收支」如何影響港池航道疏浚的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Pumping energy balance” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Harbor-basin and navigation-channel dredging”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"水力功率代表流體得到的機械能，電功率還需除以泵與驅動效率，不能拿銘牌最大值代替工況。漿體密度、總水頭和流量必須來自同一時段，效率又隨運轉點改變；這項收支可診斷異常，但無法獨立決定設備選型或允許負載。 假設泥漿ρ=1300kg/m³、Q=2m³/s、總水頭20m、總效率0.70，Pin=ρgQH/η=728.7kW；效率固定示意。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「泵送能量收支」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Hydraulic power is mechanical energy delivered to the fluid, while input power additionally reflects pump and drive efficiency. Nameplate maximum is not an operating measurement. Density, total head and flow must describe the same period, and efficiency varies with operating point. This balance helps diagnose discrepancies but does not independently select machinery or establish its permissible load. Assume slurry1300kg/m³,Q=2m³/s,total head20m and total efficiency0.70. Pin=ρgQH/η=728.7kW with fixed illustrative efficiency. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Pumping energy balance” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「泵的電力消耗增加就一定代表乾固體疏浚產量增加。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Increased pump electricity consumption always means increased dry-solid dredging production.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「泵送能量收支」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Pumping energy balance”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-17-k1","title":"泵送能量收支","titleEn":"Pumping energy balance","text":"水力功率代表流體得到的機械能，電功率還需除以泵與驅動效率，不能拿銘牌最大值代替工況。漿體密度、總水頭和流量必須來自同一時段，效率又隨運轉點改變；這項收支可診斷異常，但無法獨立決定設備選型或允許負載。","textEn":"Hydraulic power is mechanical energy delivered to the fluid, while input power additionally reflects pump and drive efficiency. Nameplate maximum is not an operating measurement.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：泵的電力消耗增加就一定代表乾固體疏浚產量增加。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Increased pump electricity consumption always means increased dry-solid dredging production. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「泵送能量收支」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pumping energy balance\" is correct?","options":["泵的電力消耗增加就一定代表乾固體疏浚產量增加。","測得聲波往返距離後不必考慮探頭吃水與潮位修正。","水力功率代表流體得到的機械能，電功率還需除以泵與驅動效率，不能拿銘牌最大值代替工況。"],"optionsEn":["Increased pump electricity consumption always means increased dry-solid dredging production.","Acoustic range alone gives charted bed elevation without draft or tide correction.","Hydraulic power is mechanical energy delivered to the fluid, while input power additionally reflects pump and drive efficiency."],"answer":2,"explanation":"水力功率代表流體得到的機械能，電功率還需除以泵與驅動效率，不能拿銘牌最大值代替工況。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Hydraulic power is mechanical energy delivered to the fluid, while input power additionally reflects pump and drive efficiency. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b287-v15-18","title":"泵送能量收支：定量估算","titleEn":"Pumping energy balance: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「泵送能量收支」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Pumping energy balance” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設泥漿ρ=1300kg/m³、Q=2m³/s、總水頭20m、總效率0.70，Pin=ρgQH/η=728.7kW；效率固定示意。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume slurry1300kg/m³,Q=2m³/s,total head20m and total efficiency0.70. Pin=ρgQH/η=728.7kW with fixed illustrative efficiency. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：同步記電力、流量、進出口總水頭和密度，區分瞬時與平均資料。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record power, flow, inlet-outlet total head and density synchronously, distinguishing instantaneous and average records.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設泥漿ρ=1300kg/m³、Q=2m³/s、總水頭20m、總效率0.70，Pin=ρgQH/η=728.7kW；效率固定示意。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume slurry1300kg/m³,Q=2m³/s,total head20m and total efficiency0.70. Pin=ρgQH/η=728.7kW with fixed illustrative efficiency.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「泵送能量收支」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pumping energy balance\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","靜態水深大於吃水就代表任何航速與波況都可以通航。","九成九固體截留率可以自動證明回流水符合所有環境要求。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Water depth exceeding draft permits navigation at every speed and wave condition.","Ninety-nine-percent solid retention automatically proves that return water meets every environmental requirement."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b287-v15-19","title":"泵送能量收支：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Pumping energy balance: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「泵送能量收支」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pumping energy balance” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"同步記電力、流量、進出口總水頭和密度，區分瞬時與平均資料。用實測工況核對效率範圍，查找水頭漏項與機械損失，不能因公式吻合就忽略振動或材料輸送異常。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record power, flow, inlet-outlet total head and density synchronously, distinguishing instantaneous and average records. Check efficiency at the measured operating point and investigate missing head terms or mechanical losses without overlooking vibration or transport abnormalities merely because arithmetic agrees. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：同步記電力、流量、進出口總水頭和密度，區分瞬時與平均資料。用實測工況核對效率範圍，查找水頭漏項與機械損失，不能因公式吻合就忽略振動或材料輸送異常。","observationEn":"Site practice: Record power, flow, inlet-outlet total head and density synchronously, distinguishing instantaneous and average records. Check efficiency at the measured operating point and investigate missing head terms or mechanical losses without overlooking vibration or transport abnormalities merely because arithmetic agrees.","failure":"注意干擾：用清水密度計算高濃度泥漿會低估功率，忽略吸入端速度和高程也會漏掉水頭。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using clear-water density for concentrated slurry understates power, while omitted suction velocity and elevation miss head terms. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"同步記電力、流量、進出口總水頭和密度，區分瞬時與平均資料。用實測工況核對效率範圍，查找水頭漏項與機械損失，不能因公式吻合就忽略振動或材料輸送異常。","textEn":"Record power, flow, inlet-outlet total head and density synchronously, distinguishing instantaneous and average records. Check efficiency at the measured operating point and investigate missing head terms or mechanical losses without overlooking vibration or transport abnormalities merely because arithmetic agrees.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"同步記電力、流量、進出口總水頭和密度，區分瞬時與平均資料。用實測工況核對效率範圍，查找水頭漏項與機械損失，不能因公式吻合就忽略振動或材料輸送異常。","textEn":"Record power, flow, inlet-outlet total head and density synchronously, distinguishing instantaneous and average records. Check efficiency at the measured operating point and investigate missing head terms or mechanical losses without overlooking vibration or transport abnormalities merely because arithmetic agrees.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「泵送能量收支」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pumping energy balance\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","同步記電力、流量、進出口總水頭和密度，區分瞬時與平均資料。","固體質量百分比和固體體積百分比可以不加換算直接互用。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Record power, flow, inlet-outlet total head and density synchronously, distinguishing instantaneous and average records.","Solid mass percentage and solid volume percentage are interchangeable without conversion."],"answer":1,"explanation":"同步記電力、流量、進出口總水頭和密度，區分瞬時與平均資料。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record power, flow, inlet-outlet total head and density synchronously, distinguishing instantaneous and average records. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b287-v15-20","title":"泵送能量收支：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pumping energy balance: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「泵送能量收支」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pumping energy balance” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"用清水密度計算高濃度泥漿會低估功率，忽略吸入端速度和高程也會漏掉水頭。設備電力增加可能來自效率下降，並不一定代表固體生產增加。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using clear-water density for concentrated slurry understates power, while omitted suction velocity and elevation miss head terms. Higher electrical consumption can result from declining efficiency rather than increased production of useful dry solids. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設泥漿ρ=1300kg/m³、Q=2m³/s、總水頭20m、總效率0.70，Pin=ρgQH/η=728.7kW；效率固定示意。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Pin=ρgQH/η=728.7kW with fixed illustrative efficiency.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「泵的電力消耗增加就一定代表乾固體疏浚產量增加。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Increased pump electricity consumption always means increased dry-solid dredging production.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"用清水密度計算高濃度泥漿會低估功率，忽略吸入端速度和高程也會漏掉水頭。設備電力增加可能來自效率下降，並不一定代表固體生產增加。","textEn":"Using clear-water density for concentrated slurry understates power, while omitted suction velocity and elevation miss head terms. Higher electrical consumption can result from declining efficiency rather than increased production of useful dry solids.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「泵送能量收支」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pumping energy balance\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","測得聲波往返距離後不必考慮探頭吃水與潮位修正。","用清水密度計算高濃度泥漿會低估功率，忽略吸入端速度和高程也會漏掉水頭。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Acoustic range alone gives charted bed elevation without draft or tide correction.","Using clear-water density for concentrated slurry understates power, while omitted suction velocity and elevation miss head terms."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用清水密度計算高濃度泥漿會低估功率，忽略吸入端速度和高程也會漏掉水頭。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using clear-water density for concentrated slurry understates power, while omitted suction velocity and elevation miss head terms. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b287-v15-21","title":"聲波測深與基準：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Acoustic depth and datum: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-20"],"objective":"說明「聲波測深與基準」如何影響港池航道疏浚的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Acoustic depth and datum” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Harbor-basin and navigation-channel dredging”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"測深由聲波往返時間轉成距離，探頭吃水、船體升沉和潮位又把距離轉成海床高程。聲速剖面隨溫鹽改變，斜波束更容易出現折射偏差；只校正一個表面聲速不足以代表整個水柱，且各項修正必須保持相同符號約定。 假設垂直聲束、均勻聲速1500m/s、往返0.020s，探頭至床距15m；探頭在瞬時水面下1m時水深16m。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「聲波測深與基準」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Sounding converts two-way travel time into range, then transducer draft, vessel motion and tide convert range into bed elevation. Temperature and salinity alter the sound-speed profile, particularly affecting oblique beams through refraction. A surface-only correction does not describe the whole water column, and every correction requires a consistent sign convention and reference frame. Assume a vertical beam, uniform sound speed1500m/s and two-way time0.020s. Transducer-bed range is15m;1m transducer draft gives water depth16m. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Acoustic depth and datum” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「測得聲波往返距離後不必考慮探頭吃水與潮位修正。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Acoustic range alone gives charted bed elevation without draft or tide correction.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「聲波測深與基準」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Acoustic depth and datum”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-21-k1","title":"聲波測深與基準","titleEn":"Acoustic depth and datum","text":"測深由聲波往返時間轉成距離，探頭吃水、船體升沉和潮位又把距離轉成海床高程。聲速剖面隨溫鹽改變，斜波束更容易出現折射偏差；只校正一個表面聲速不足以代表整個水柱，且各項修正必須保持相同符號約定。","textEn":"Sounding converts two-way travel time into range, then transducer draft, vessel motion and tide convert range into bed elevation. Temperature and salinity alter the sound-speed profile, particularly affecting oblique beams through refraction.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：測得聲波往返距離後不必考慮探頭吃水與潮位修正。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Acoustic range alone gives charted bed elevation without draft or tide correction. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「聲波測深與基準」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Acoustic depth and datum\" is correct?","options":["測深由聲波往返時間轉成距離，探頭吃水、船體升沉和潮位又把距離轉成海床高程。","測得聲波往返距離後不必考慮探頭吃水與潮位修正。","測深標準不確定度很小就表示所有航道障礙物都被找到。"],"optionsEn":["Sounding converts two-way travel time into range, then transducer draft, vessel motion and tide convert range into bed elevation.","Acoustic range alone gives charted bed elevation without draft or tide correction.","Small sounding uncertainty proves that every channel obstruction has been detected."],"answer":0,"explanation":"測深由聲波往返時間轉成距離，探頭吃水、船體升沉和潮位又把距離轉成海床高程。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Sounding converts two-way travel time into range, then transducer draft, vessel motion and tide convert range into bed elevation. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b287-v15-22","title":"聲波測深與基準：定量估算","titleEn":"Acoustic depth and datum: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「聲波測深與基準」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Acoustic depth and datum” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設垂直聲束、均勻聲速1500m/s、往返0.020s，探頭至床距15m；探頭在瞬時水面下1m時水深16m。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume a vertical beam, uniform sound speed1500m/s and two-way time0.020s. Transducer-bed range is15m;1m transducer draft gives water depth16m. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：畫水面、探頭和海床的高程關係，逐項核對吃水、升沉與潮位符號。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Draw elevations of water surface, transducer and bed and verify draft, heave and tide signs.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設垂直聲束、均勻聲速1500m/s、往返0.020s，探頭至床距15m；探頭在瞬時水面下1m時水深16m。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume a vertical beam, uniform sound speed1500m/s and two-way time0.020s. Transducer-bed range is15m;1m transducer draft gives water depth16m.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「聲波測深與基準」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Acoustic depth and datum\", which statement holds?","options":["每次滿艙容量乘理論班次就是已驗收的航道完成方量。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","航道平均深度達標就代表每個局部淺點都已移除。"],"optionsEn":["Full hopper capacity times theoretical cycles equals accepted completed channel excavation.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Meeting average channel depth proves that every local controlling shoal has been removed."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b287-v15-23","title":"聲波測深與基準：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Acoustic depth and datum: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「聲波測深與基準」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Acoustic depth and datum” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"畫水面、探頭和海床的高程關係，逐項核對吃水、升沉與潮位符號。用獨立檢核線和聲速剖面測試折射，保留時鐘及姿態校準紀錄，避免只看點雲外觀平順。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Draw elevations of water surface, transducer and bed and verify draft, heave and tide signs. Test refraction with independent check lines and sound-speed profiles, retaining timing and attitude calibration instead of relying solely on smooth point-cloud appearance. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：畫水面、探頭和海床的高程關係，逐項核對吃水、升沉與潮位符號。用獨立檢核線和聲速剖面測試折射，保留時鐘及姿態校準紀錄，避免只看點雲外觀平順。","observationEn":"Site practice: Draw elevations of water surface, transducer and bed and verify draft, heave and tide signs. Test refraction with independent check lines and sound-speed profiles, retaining timing and attitude calibration instead of relying solely on smooth point-cloud appearance.","failure":"注意干擾：聲速設錯會造成整條測線深度偏差，吃水符號反轉又能讓誤差加倍。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Incorrect sound speed biases the entire line, while reversed draft signs can amplify the error. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"畫水面、探頭和海床的高程關係，逐項核對吃水、升沉與潮位符號。用獨立檢核線和聲速剖面測試折射，保留時鐘及姿態校準紀錄，避免只看點雲外觀平順。","textEn":"Draw elevations of water surface, transducer and bed and verify draft, heave and tide signs. Test refraction with independent check lines and sound-speed profiles, retaining timing and attitude calibration instead of relying solely on smooth point-cloud appearance.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"畫水面、探頭和海床的高程關係，逐項核對吃水、升沉與潮位符號。用獨立檢核線和聲速剖面測試折射，保留時鐘及姿態校準紀錄，避免只看點雲外觀平順。","textEn":"Draw elevations of water surface, transducer and bed and verify draft, heave and tide signs. Test refraction with independent check lines and sound-speed profiles, retaining timing and attitude calibration instead of relying solely on smooth point-cloud appearance.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「聲波測深與基準」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Acoustic depth and datum\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","泥漿流量全部等於真正挖出的乾固體體積流量。","畫水面、探頭和海床的高程關係，逐項核對吃水、升沉與潮位符號。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","The entire slurry discharge equals the actual excavated dry-solid volume flow.","Draw elevations of water surface, transducer and bed and verify draft, heave and tide signs."],"answer":2,"explanation":"畫水面、探頭和海床的高程關係，逐項核對吃水、升沉與潮位符號。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Draw elevations of water surface, transducer and bed and verify draft, heave and tide signs. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b287-v15-24","title":"聲波測深與基準：失效診斷","titleEn":"Acoustic depth and datum: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「聲波測深與基準」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Acoustic depth and datum” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"聲速設錯會造成整條測線深度偏差，吃水符號反轉又能讓誤差加倍。不同方向測線看似吻合時，仍可能共同受錯誤高程基準影響而一起偏移。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Incorrect sound speed biases the entire line, while reversed draft signs can amplify the error. Agreement between opposite survey directions can still conceal a shared incorrect vertical datum that shifts both sets of depths together. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設垂直聲束、均勻聲速1500m/s、往返0.020s，探頭至床距15m；探頭在瞬時水面下1m時水深16m。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Transducer-bed range is15m;1m transducer draft gives water depth16m.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「測得聲波往返距離後不必考慮探頭吃水與潮位修正。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Acoustic range alone gives charted bed elevation without draft or tide correction.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"聲速設錯會造成整條測線深度偏差，吃水符號反轉又能讓誤差加倍。不同方向測線看似吻合時，仍可能共同受錯誤高程基準影響而一起偏移。","textEn":"Incorrect sound speed biases the entire line, while reversed draft signs can amplify the error. Agreement between opposite survey directions can still conceal a shared incorrect vertical datum that shifts both sets of depths together.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「聲波測深與基準」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Acoustic depth and datum\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["聲速設錯會造成整條測線深度偏差，吃水符號反轉又能讓誤差加倍。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","測深標準不確定度很小就表示所有航道障礙物都被找到。"],"optionsEn":["Incorrect sound speed biases the entire line, while reversed draft signs can amplify the error.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","Small sounding uncertainty proves that every channel obstruction has been detected."],"answer":0,"explanation":"聲速設錯會造成整條測線深度偏差，吃水符號反轉又能讓誤差加倍。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Incorrect sound speed biases the entire line, while reversed draft signs can amplify the error. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b287-v15-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「測深不確定度預算」與「船底淨空分項」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Sounding uncertainty budget\" and \"Under-keel clearance components\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b287-v15-25","title":"測深不確定度預算：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Sounding uncertainty budget: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-24"],"objective":"說明「測深不確定度預算」如何影響港池航道疏浚的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Sounding uncertainty budget” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Harbor-basin and navigation-channel dredging”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"深度不確定度來自儀器、聲速、姿態和基準等分量，獨立隨機分量才能直接平方和。覆蓋率和小物體偵測又屬不同品質維度，精度高並不表示沒有漏測；合成預算用來理解誤差傳播，不是在未指定測量等級時自行宣告符合國際標準。 假設三個獨立零均值標準不確定度0.05、0.08、0.04m，合成σ=√(0.05²+0.08²+0.04²)=0.1025m。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「測深不確定度預算」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Depth uncertainty combines instrument, sound-speed, attitude and reference contributions, with direct quadrature applying only to independent random components. Coverage and feature detection are separate quality dimensions: accurate points can still leave unseen obstructions. A synthetic budget illustrates propagation rather than claiming compliance with an international survey order that has not been specified and verified. Assume independent zero-mean standard uncertainties0.05,0.08 and0.04m. Combinedσ=√(0.05²+0.08²+0.04²)=0.1025m, excluding systematic bias. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Sounding uncertainty budget” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「測深標準不確定度很小就表示所有航道障礙物都被找到。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Small sounding uncertainty proves that every channel obstruction has been detected.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「測深不確定度預算」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Sounding uncertainty budget”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-25-k1","title":"測深不確定度預算","titleEn":"Sounding uncertainty budget","text":"深度不確定度來自儀器、聲速、姿態和基準等分量，獨立隨機分量才能直接平方和。覆蓋率和小物體偵測又屬不同品質維度，精度高並不表示沒有漏測；合成預算用來理解誤差傳播，不是在未指定測量等級時自行宣告符合國際標準。","textEn":"Depth uncertainty combines instrument, sound-speed, attitude and reference contributions, with direct quadrature applying only to independent random components. Coverage and feature detection are separate quality dimensions: accurate points can still leave unseen obstructions.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：測深標準不確定度很小就表示所有航道障礙物都被找到。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Small sounding uncertainty proves that every channel obstruction has been detected. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「測深不確定度預算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Sounding uncertainty budget\" is correct?","options":["測深標準不確定度很小就表示所有航道障礙物都被找到。","深度不確定度來自儀器、聲速、姿態和基準等分量，獨立隨機分量才能直接平方和。","靜態水深大於吃水就代表任何航速與波況都可以通航。"],"optionsEn":["Small sounding uncertainty proves that every channel obstruction has been detected.","Depth uncertainty combines instrument, sound-speed, attitude and reference contributions, with direct quadrature applying only to independent random components.","Water depth exceeding draft permits navigation at every speed and wave condition."],"answer":1,"explanation":"深度不確定度來自儀器、聲速、姿態和基準等分量，獨立隨機分量才能直接平方和。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Depth uncertainty combines instrument, sound-speed, attitude and reference contributions, with direct quadrature applying only to independent random components. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b287-v15-26","title":"測深不確定度預算：定量估算","titleEn":"Sounding uncertainty budget: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「測深不確定度預算」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Sounding uncertainty budget” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設三個獨立零均值標準不確定度0.05、0.08、0.04m，合成σ=√(0.05²+0.08²+0.04²)=0.1025m。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume independent zero-mean standard uncertainties0.05,0.08 and0.04m. Combinedσ=√(0.05²+0.08²+0.04²)=0.1025m, excluding systematic bias. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：將標準不確定度、偏差及信賴界限分欄，說明每個分量是否相關。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Separate standard uncertainty, bias and confidence limits and identify correlations between components.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設三個獨立零均值標準不確定度0.05、0.08、0.04m，合成σ=√(0.05²+0.08²+0.04²)=0.1025m。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume independent zero-mean standard uncertainties0.05,0.08 and0.04m. Combinedσ=√(0.05²+0.08²+0.04²)=0.1025m, excluding systematic bias.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「測深不確定度預算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Sounding uncertainty budget\", which statement holds?","options":["九成九固體截留率可以自動證明回流水符合所有環境要求。","固體質量百分比和固體體積百分比可以不加換算直接互用。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["Ninety-nine-percent solid retention automatically proves that return water meets every environmental requirement.","Solid mass percentage and solid volume percentage are interchangeable without conversion.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b287-v15-27","title":"測深不確定度預算：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Sounding uncertainty budget: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「測深不確定度預算」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Sounding uncertainty budget” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"將標準不確定度、偏差及信賴界限分欄，說明每個分量是否相關。另查測線覆蓋與物體偵測證據，把品質要求連回調查用途，避免以單一平方和取代整體測量驗證。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Separate standard uncertainty, bias and confidence limits and identify correlations between components. Check coverage and feature-detection evidence independently, linking requirements to intended use rather than replacing complete survey verification with one combined quadrature value. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將標準不確定度、偏差及信賴界限分欄，說明每個分量是否相關。另查測線覆蓋與物體偵測證據，把品質要求連回調查用途，避免以單一平方和取代整體測量驗證。","observationEn":"Site practice: Separate standard uncertainty, bias and confidence limits and identify correlations between components. Check coverage and feature-detection evidence independently, linking requirements to intended use rather than replacing complete survey verification with one combined quadrature value.","failure":"注意干擾：相關的潮位和基準誤差被假設獨立會低估不確定度，未測間隙中的石塊更不在預算內。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Assuming independence between correlated tide and datum errors understates uncertainty, while a rock in an unsurveyed gap is absent from the budget entirely. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"將標準不確定度、偏差及信賴界限分欄，說明每個分量是否相關。另查測線覆蓋與物體偵測證據，把品質要求連回調查用途，避免以單一平方和取代整體測量驗證。","textEn":"Separate standard uncertainty, bias and confidence limits and identify correlations between components. Check coverage and feature-detection evidence independently, linking requirements to intended use rather than replacing complete survey verification with one combined quadrature value.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將標準不確定度、偏差及信賴界限分欄，說明每個分量是否相關。另查測線覆蓋與物體偵測證據，把品質要求連回調查用途，避免以單一平方和取代整體測量驗證。","textEn":"Separate standard uncertainty, bias and confidence limits and identify correlations between components. Check coverage and feature-detection evidence independently, linking requirements to intended use rather than replacing complete survey verification with one combined quadrature value.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「測深不確定度預算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Sounding uncertainty budget\"?","options":["將標準不確定度、偏差及信賴界限分欄，說明每個分量是否相關。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","清水管損公式無需任何修正就能保證高濃度泥漿可輸送。"],"optionsEn":["Separate standard uncertainty, bias and confidence limits and identify correlations between components.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","An uncorrected clear-water friction formula guarantees transport of concentrated dredging slurry."],"answer":0,"explanation":"將標準不確定度、偏差及信賴界限分欄，說明每個分量是否相關。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Separate standard uncertainty, bias and confidence limits and identify correlations between components. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b287-v15-28","title":"測深不確定度預算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Sounding uncertainty budget: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「測深不確定度預算」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Sounding uncertainty budget” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"相關的潮位和基準誤差被假設獨立會低估不確定度，未測間隙中的石塊更不在預算內。漂亮的精度數字無法補救航道關鍵區沒有資料的問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Assuming independence between correlated tide and datum errors understates uncertainty, while a rock in an unsurveyed gap is absent from the budget entirely. Impressive precision cannot compensate for missing observations in controlling navigation areas. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設三個獨立零均值標準不確定度0.05、0.08、0.04m，合成σ=√(0.05²+0.08²+0.04²)=0.1025m。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Combinedσ=√(0.05²+0.08²+0.04²)=0.1025m, excluding systematic bias.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「測深標準不確定度很小就表示所有航道障礙物都被找到。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Small sounding uncertainty proves that every channel obstruction has been detected.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"相關的潮位和基準誤差被假設獨立會低估不確定度，未測間隙中的石塊更不在預算內。漂亮的精度數字無法補救航道關鍵區沒有資料的問題。","textEn":"Assuming independence between correlated tide and datum errors understates uncertainty, while a rock in an unsurveyed gap is absent from the budget entirely. Impressive precision cannot compensate for missing observations in controlling navigation areas.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「測深不確定度預算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Sounding uncertainty budget\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","相關的潮位和基準誤差被假設獨立會低估不確定度，未測間隙中的石塊更不在預算內。","靜態水深大於吃水就代表任何航速與波況都可以通航。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Assuming independence between correlated tide and datum errors understates uncertainty, while a rock in an unsurveyed gap is absent from the budget entirely.","Water depth exceeding draft permits navigation at every speed and wave condition."],"answer":1,"explanation":"相關的潮位和基準誤差被假設獨立會低估不確定度，未測間隙中的石塊更不在預算內。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Assuming independence between correlated tide and datum errors understates uncertainty, while a rock in an unsurveyed gap is absent from the budget entirely. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b287-v15-29","title":"船底淨空分項：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Under-keel clearance components: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-28"],"objective":"說明「船底淨空分項」如何影響港池航道疏浚的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Under-keel clearance components” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Harbor-basin and navigation-channel dredging”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"航道水深與船舶吃水差只是靜態淨空，航行時還有船體動態下沉、波浪運動及量測餘量。各項需求可能相關且受場址限制，教學減法僅用來顯示預算組成；不能將結果當作船舶通行批准，真正操航需依權責單位規定和即時條件。 假設可用水深15m、吃水13m、動態下沉0.5m、波動需求0.4m、量測餘量0.2m，剩餘示意淨空0.9m。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「船底淨空分項」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Depth minus draft is only static clearance. Vessel squat, wave motion and measurement allowances affect the available margin during navigation. Demands may be correlated and site-dependent, so this arithmetic merely exposes budget components. It is not a transit approval; actual navigation depends on the responsible authority, vessel characteristics and contemporaneous conditions rather than this illustrative calculation. Assume depth15m,draft13m,squat0.5m,wave demand0.4m and survey allowance0.2m. Illustrative residual clearance is0.9m, not permission to transit. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Under-keel clearance components” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「靜態水深大於吃水就代表任何航速與波況都可以通航。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Water depth exceeding draft permits navigation at every speed and wave condition.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「船底淨空分項」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Under-keel clearance components”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-29-k1","title":"船底淨空分項","titleEn":"Under-keel clearance components","text":"航道水深與船舶吃水差只是靜態淨空，航行時還有船體動態下沉、波浪運動及量測餘量。各項需求可能相關且受場址限制，教學減法僅用來顯示預算組成；不能將結果當作船舶通行批准，真正操航需依權責單位規定和即時條件。","textEn":"Depth minus draft is only static clearance. Vessel squat, wave motion and measurement allowances affect the available margin during navigation.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：靜態水深大於吃水就代表任何航速與波況都可以通航。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Water depth exceeding draft permits navigation at every speed and wave condition. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「船底淨空分項」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Under-keel clearance components\" is correct?","options":["靜態水深大於吃水就代表任何航速與波況都可以通航。","每次滿艙容量乘理論班次就是已驗收的航道完成方量。","航道水深與船舶吃水差只是靜態淨空，航行時還有船體動態下沉、波浪運動及量測餘量。"],"optionsEn":["Water depth exceeding draft permits navigation at every speed and wave condition.","Full hopper capacity times theoretical cycles equals accepted completed channel excavation.","Depth minus draft is only static clearance."],"answer":2,"explanation":"航道水深與船舶吃水差只是靜態淨空，航行時還有船體動態下沉、波浪運動及量測餘量。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Depth minus draft is only static clearance. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b287-v15-30","title":"船底淨空分項：定量估算","titleEn":"Under-keel clearance components: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「船底淨空分項」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Under-keel clearance components” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設可用水深15m、吃水13m、動態下沉0.5m、波動需求0.4m、量測餘量0.2m，剩餘示意淨空0.9m。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume depth15m,draft13m,squat0.5m,wave demand0.4m and survey allowance0.2m. Illustrative residual clearance is0.9m, not permission to transit. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：明列水位時刻、吃水來源與各需求的定義，檢查是否有重複或漏計。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record water-level time, draft source and each demand definition, checking duplication and omission.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設可用水深15m、吃水13m、動態下沉0.5m、波動需求0.4m、量測餘量0.2m，剩餘示意淨空0.9m。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume depth15m,draft13m,squat0.5m,wave demand0.4m and survey allowance0.2m. Illustrative residual clearance is0.9m, not permission to transit.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「船底淨空分項」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Under-keel clearance components\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","航道平均深度達標就代表每個局部淺點都已移除。","泥漿流量全部等於真正挖出的乾固體體積流量。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Meeting average channel depth proves that every local controlling shoal has been removed.","The entire slurry discharge equals the actual excavated dry-solid volume flow."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b287-v15-31","title":"船底淨空分項：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Under-keel clearance components: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「船底淨空分項」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Under-keel clearance components” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"明列水位時刻、吃水來源與各需求的定義，檢查是否有重複或漏計。將示意預算與權責單位的場址方法分開保存，核對船型、航速及波向適用性，不以平均水深代替最淺點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record water-level time, draft source and each demand definition, checking duplication and omission. Keep this illustration separate from the authority’s site method, verify vessel, speed and wave-direction applicability, and use controlling shallows rather than average depth. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：明列水位時刻、吃水來源與各需求的定義，檢查是否有重複或漏計。將示意預算與權責單位的場址方法分開保存，核對船型、航速及波向適用性，不以平均水深代替最淺點。","observationEn":"Site practice: Record water-level time, draft source and each demand definition, checking duplication and omission. Keep this illustration separate from the authority’s site method, verify vessel, speed and wave-direction applicability, and use controlling shallows rather than average depth.","failure":"注意干擾：忽略動態下沉會在靜態淨空看似充裕時低估碰底可能，混用潮位時刻也會錯估可用水深。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Ignoring squat can understate bottom-contact exposure despite apparently adequate static clearance, and mismatched tide times misstate depth. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"明列水位時刻、吃水來源與各需求的定義，檢查是否有重複或漏計。將示意預算與權責單位的場址方法分開保存，核對船型、航速及波向適用性，不以平均水深代替最淺點。","textEn":"Record water-level time, draft source and each demand definition, checking duplication and omission. Keep this illustration separate from the authority’s site method, verify vessel, speed and wave-direction applicability, and use controlling shallows rather than average depth.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"明列水位時刻、吃水來源與各需求的定義，檢查是否有重複或漏計。將示意預算與權責單位的場址方法分開保存，核對船型、航速及波向適用性，不以平均水深代替最淺點。","textEn":"Record water-level time, draft source and each demand definition, checking duplication and omission. Keep this illustration separate from the authority’s site method, verify vessel, speed and wave-direction applicability, and use controlling shallows rather than average depth.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「船底淨空分項」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Under-keel clearance components\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","明列水位時刻、吃水來源與各需求的定義，檢查是否有重複或漏計。","泵的電力消耗增加就一定代表乾固體疏浚產量增加。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Record water-level time, draft source and each demand definition, checking duplication and omission.","Increased pump electricity consumption always means increased dry-solid dredging production."],"answer":1,"explanation":"明列水位時刻、吃水來源與各需求的定義，檢查是否有重複或漏計。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record water-level time, draft source and each demand definition, checking duplication and omission. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b287-v15-32","title":"船底淨空分項：失效診斷","titleEn":"Under-keel clearance components: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「船底淨空分項」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Under-keel clearance components” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"忽略動態下沉會在靜態淨空看似充裕時低估碰底可能，混用潮位時刻也會錯估可用水深。多個保守餘量重複扣除則可能讓分析失去可追溯性。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Ignoring squat can understate bottom-contact exposure despite apparently adequate static clearance, and mismatched tide times misstate depth. Duplicating conservative allowances creates the opposite error and makes the resulting assessment difficult to audit or interpret. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設可用水深15m、吃水13m、動態下沉0.5m、波動需求0.4m、量測餘量0.2m，剩餘示意淨空0.9m。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Illustrative residual clearance is0.9m, not permission to transit.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「靜態水深大於吃水就代表任何航速與波況都可以通航。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Water depth exceeding draft permits navigation at every speed and wave condition.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"忽略動態下沉會在靜態淨空看似充裕時低估碰底可能，混用潮位時刻也會錯估可用水深。多個保守餘量重複扣除則可能讓分析失去可追溯性。","textEn":"Ignoring squat can understate bottom-contact exposure despite apparently adequate static clearance, and mismatched tide times misstate depth. Duplicating conservative allowances creates the opposite error and makes the resulting assessment difficult to audit or interpret.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「船底淨空分項」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Under-keel clearance components\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","每次滿艙容量乘理論班次就是已驗收的航道完成方量。","忽略動態下沉會在靜態淨空看似充裕時低估碰底可能，混用潮位時刻也會錯估可用水深。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Full hopper capacity times theoretical cycles equals accepted completed channel excavation.","Ignoring squat can understate bottom-contact exposure despite apparently adequate static clearance, and mismatched tide times misstate depth."],"answer":2,"explanation":"忽略動態下沉會在靜態淨空看似充裕時低估碰底可能，混用潮位時刻也會錯估可用水深。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Ignoring squat can understate bottom-contact exposure despite apparently adequate static clearance, and mismatched tide times misstate depth. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b287-v15-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「循環時間與產量」與「回流水固體平衡」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Cycle time and production\" and \"Return-water solids balance\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b287-v15-33","title":"循環時間與產量：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Cycle time and production: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-32"],"objective":"說明「循環時間與產量」如何影響港池航道疏浚的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Cycle time and production” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Harbor-basin and navigation-channel dredging”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"耙吸船或抓斗作業有挖取、移動、卸料及等待階段，只有完整循環才能換算持續產量。有效利用率需明確說明是否已包含等待，避免重複扣除；料艙容量亦非原狀土方，材料膨鬆與含水會使不同產量報表無法直接比較。 假設每循環合格完成方600m³、循環時間40min且另計可用率0.75，平均600×60/40×0.75=675m³/h。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「循環時間與產量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A dredging cycle includes excavation, travel, unloading and waiting, so sustainable production requires the complete cycle. Utilization must state whether waiting is already included to avoid double deductions. Hopper capacity is also not in-situ soil volume; bulking and water content make reports with different volume definitions unsuitable for direct comparison across equipment or shifts. Assume completed acceptable volume600m³ per40min cycle and separately defined availability0.75. Mean production=600×60/40×0.75=675m³/h. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Cycle time and production” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「每次滿艙容量乘理論班次就是已驗收的航道完成方量。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Full hopper capacity times theoretical cycles equals accepted completed channel excavation.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「循環時間與產量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Cycle time and production”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-33-k1","title":"循環時間與產量","titleEn":"Cycle time and production","text":"耙吸船或抓斗作業有挖取、移動、卸料及等待階段，只有完整循環才能換算持續產量。有效利用率需明確說明是否已包含等待，避免重複扣除；料艙容量亦非原狀土方，材料膨鬆與含水會使不同產量報表無法直接比較。","textEn":"A dredging cycle includes excavation, travel, unloading and waiting, so sustainable production requires the complete cycle. Utilization must state whether waiting is already included to avoid double deductions.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：每次滿艙容量乘理論班次就是已驗收的航道完成方量。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Full hopper capacity times theoretical cycles equals accepted completed channel excavation. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「循環時間與產量」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Cycle time and production\" is correct?","options":["耙吸船或抓斗作業有挖取、移動、卸料及等待階段，只有完整循環才能換算持續產量。","每次滿艙容量乘理論班次就是已驗收的航道完成方量。","九成九固體截留率可以自動證明回流水符合所有環境要求。"],"optionsEn":["A dredging cycle includes excavation, travel, unloading and waiting, so sustainable production requires the complete cycle.","Full hopper capacity times theoretical cycles equals accepted completed channel excavation.","Ninety-nine-percent solid retention automatically proves that return water meets every environmental requirement."],"answer":0,"explanation":"耙吸船或抓斗作業有挖取、移動、卸料及等待階段，只有完整循環才能換算持續產量。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A dredging cycle includes excavation, travel, unloading and waiting, so sustainable production requires the complete cycle. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b287-v15-34","title":"循環時間與產量：定量估算","titleEn":"Cycle time and production: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「循環時間與產量」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Cycle time and production” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設每循環合格完成方600m³、循環時間40min且另計可用率0.75，平均600×60/40×0.75=675m³/h。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume completed acceptable volume600m³ per40min cycle and separately defined availability0.75. Mean production=600×60/40×0.75=675m³/h. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：用原始時戳分解循環階段，標明可用率排除或納入的停機原因。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Use raw timestamps to separate cycle phases and define included downtime in availability.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設每循環合格完成方600m³、循環時間40min且另計可用率0.75，平均600×60/40×0.75=675m³/h。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume completed acceptable volume600m³ per40min cycle and separately defined availability0.75. Mean production=600×60/40×0.75=675m³/h.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「循環時間與產量」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Cycle time and production\", which statement holds?","options":["固體質量百分比和固體體積百分比可以不加換算直接互用。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","清水管損公式無需任何修正就能保證高濃度泥漿可輸送。"],"optionsEn":["Solid mass percentage and solid volume percentage are interchangeable without conversion.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","An uncorrected clear-water friction formula guarantees transport of concentrated dredging slurry."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b287-v15-35","title":"循環時間與產量：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Cycle time and production: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「循環時間與產量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Cycle time and production” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"用原始時戳分解循環階段，標明可用率排除或納入的停機原因。核對完成方是否已由測量確認，並比較多個班次的分布，不以最快一趟或料艙名義容量代表長期績效。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Use raw timestamps to separate cycle phases and define included downtime in availability. Check whether completed volume is survey-confirmed and compare distributions across shifts rather than representing long-term performance by the fastest trip or nominal hopper capacity. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：用原始時戳分解循環階段，標明可用率排除或納入的停機原因。核對完成方是否已由測量確認，並比較多個班次的分布，不以最快一趟或料艙名義容量代表長期績效。","observationEn":"Site practice: Use raw timestamps to separate cycle phases and define included downtime in availability. Check whether completed volume is survey-confirmed and compare distributions across shifts rather than representing long-term performance by the fastest trip or nominal hopper capacity.","failure":"注意干擾：將等待時間納入循環又乘含等待的可用率會重複扣減，反之漏記卸料與移航則過度樂觀。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Counting waiting in both cycle time and availability double-reduces output, while omitting travel and unloading inflates it. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用原始時戳分解循環階段，標明可用率排除或納入的停機原因。核對完成方是否已由測量確認，並比較多個班次的分布，不以最快一趟或料艙名義容量代表長期績效。","textEn":"Use raw timestamps to separate cycle phases and define included downtime in availability. Check whether completed volume is survey-confirmed and compare distributions across shifts rather than representing long-term performance by the fastest trip or nominal hopper capacity.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"用原始時戳分解循環階段，標明可用率排除或納入的停機原因。核對完成方是否已由測量確認，並比較多個班次的分布，不以最快一趟或料艙名義容量代表長期績效。","textEn":"Use raw timestamps to separate cycle phases and define included downtime in availability. Check whether completed volume is survey-confirmed and compare distributions across shifts rather than representing long-term performance by the fastest trip or nominal hopper capacity.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「循環時間與產量」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Cycle time and production\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","測得聲波往返距離後不必考慮探頭吃水與潮位修正。","用原始時戳分解循環階段，標明可用率排除或納入的停機原因。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Acoustic range alone gives charted bed elevation without draft or tide correction.","Use raw timestamps to separate cycle phases and define included downtime in availability."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用原始時戳分解循環階段，標明可用率排除或納入的停機原因。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Use raw timestamps to separate cycle phases and define included downtime in availability. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b287-v15-36","title":"循環時間與產量：失效診斷","titleEn":"Cycle time and production: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「循環時間與產量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Cycle time and production” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"將等待時間納入循環又乘含等待的可用率會重複扣減，反之漏記卸料與移航則過度樂觀。容量達標而底部仍留淺點，也不能視為合格完成方。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Counting waiting in both cycle time and availability double-reduces output, while omitting travel and unloading inflates it. A full hopper does not represent acceptable completed excavation if controlling shallow patches remain on the bed. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設每循環合格完成方600m³、循環時間40min且另計可用率0.75，平均600×60/40×0.75=675m³/h。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Mean production=600×60/40×0.75=675m³/h.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「每次滿艙容量乘理論班次就是已驗收的航道完成方量。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Full hopper capacity times theoretical cycles equals accepted completed channel excavation.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"將等待時間納入循環又乘含等待的可用率會重複扣減，反之漏記卸料與移航則過度樂觀。容量達標而底部仍留淺點，也不能視為合格完成方。","textEn":"Counting waiting in both cycle time and availability double-reduces output, while omitting travel and unloading inflates it. A full hopper does not represent acceptable completed excavation if controlling shallow patches remain on the bed.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「循環時間與產量」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Cycle time and production\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["將等待時間納入循環又乘含等待的可用率會重複扣減，反之漏記卸料與移航則過度樂觀。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","九成九固體截留率可以自動證明回流水符合所有環境要求。"],"optionsEn":["Counting waiting in both cycle time and availability double-reduces output, while omitting travel and unloading inflates it.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Ninety-nine-percent solid retention automatically proves that return water meets every environmental requirement."],"answer":0,"explanation":"將等待時間納入循環又乘含等待的可用率會重複扣減，反之漏記卸料與移航則過度樂觀。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Counting waiting in both cycle time and availability double-reduces output, while omitting travel and unloading inflates it. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b287-v15-37","title":"回流水固體平衡：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Return-water solids balance: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-36"],"objective":"說明「回流水固體平衡」如何影響港池航道疏浚的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Return-water solids balance” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Harbor-basin and navigation-channel dredging”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"放置區回流水可能攜帶細料，輸入和排出通量需以同一時段及乾固體定義比較。截留比例只說明材料收支，不能替代水質與生態評估；沉積暫存和再懸浮也會改變短期結果，因此要避免把短時間高截留率解釋為長期永久固定。 假設乾固體輸入100kg/s、回流水2m³/s且固體0.5kg/m³，輸出1kg/s，當期截留率99%；不代表水質合格。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「回流水固體平衡」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Return water can carry fines out of a placement area, so input and output fluxes require matching periods and dry-solid definitions. Retention describes material accounting rather than water-quality or ecological acceptability. Temporary storage and resuspension alter short-term results, meaning a high measured fraction cannot demonstrate permanent confinement or the absence of downstream effects. Assume dry-solid input100kg/s and return water2m³/s at0.5kg/m³. Export is1kg/s and period retention99%, not water-quality compliance. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Return-water solids balance” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「九成九固體截留率可以自動證明回流水符合所有環境要求。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Ninety-nine-percent solid retention automatically proves that return water meets every environmental requirement.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「回流水固體平衡」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Return-water solids balance”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-37-k1","title":"回流水固體平衡","titleEn":"Return-water solids balance","text":"放置區回流水可能攜帶細料，輸入和排出通量需以同一時段及乾固體定義比較。截留比例只說明材料收支，不能替代水質與生態評估；沉積暫存和再懸浮也會改變短期結果，因此要避免把短時間高截留率解釋為長期永久固定。","textEn":"Return water can carry fines out of a placement area, so input and output fluxes require matching periods and dry-solid definitions. Retention describes material accounting rather than water-quality or ecological acceptability.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：九成九固體截留率可以自動證明回流水符合所有環境要求。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Ninety-nine-percent solid retention automatically proves that return water meets every environmental requirement. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「回流水固體平衡」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Return-water solids balance\" is correct?","options":["九成九固體截留率可以自動證明回流水符合所有環境要求。","放置區回流水可能攜帶細料，輸入和排出通量需以同一時段及乾固體定義比較。","航道平均深度達標就代表每個局部淺點都已移除。"],"optionsEn":["Ninety-nine-percent solid retention automatically proves that return water meets every environmental requirement.","Return water can carry fines out of a placement area, so input and output fluxes require matching periods and dry-solid definitions.","Meeting average channel depth proves that every local controlling shoal has been removed."],"answer":1,"explanation":"放置區回流水可能攜帶細料，輸入和排出通量需以同一時段及乾固體定義比較。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Return water can carry fines out of a placement area, so input and output fluxes require matching periods and dry-solid definitions. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b287-v15-38","title":"回流水固體平衡：定量估算","titleEn":"Return-water solids balance: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「回流水固體平衡」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Return-water solids balance” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設乾固體輸入100kg/s、回流水2m³/s且固體0.5kg/m³，輸出1kg/s，當期截留率99%；不代表水質合格。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume dry-solid input100kg/s and return water2m³/s at0.5kg/m³. Export is1kg/s and period retention99%, not water-quality compliance. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：同步量入料與回流水濃度流量，確認排水口是否全部納入，並扣除可辨識的原床再懸浮。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure input and all return outlets synchronously and account for identifiable native-bed resuspension.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設乾固體輸入100kg/s、回流水2m³/s且固體0.5kg/m³，輸出1kg/s，當期截留率99%；不代表水質合格。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume dry-solid input100kg/s and return water2m³/s at0.5kg/m³. Export is1kg/s and period retention99%, not water-quality compliance.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「回流水固體平衡」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Return-water solids balance\", which statement holds?","options":["泥漿流量全部等於真正挖出的乾固體體積流量。","泵的電力消耗增加就一定代表乾固體疏浚產量增加。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["The entire slurry discharge equals the actual excavated dry-solid volume flow.","Increased pump electricity consumption always means increased dry-solid dredging production.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b287-v15-39","title":"回流水固體平衡：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Return-water solids balance: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「回流水固體平衡」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Return-water solids balance” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"同步量入料與回流水濃度流量，確認排水口是否全部納入，並扣除可辨識的原床再懸浮。用分期地形和乾固體存量核對積分收支，將環境暴露與截留率分開呈現。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure input and all return outlets synchronously and account for identifiable native-bed resuspension. Check integrated fluxes against repeated terrain and dry-solid storage observations, presenting environmental exposure separately from the numerical fraction retained during the selected period. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：同步量入料與回流水濃度流量，確認排水口是否全部納入，並扣除可辨識的原床再懸浮。用分期地形和乾固體存量核對積分收支，將環境暴露與截留率分開呈現。","observationEn":"Site practice: Measure input and all return outlets synchronously and account for identifiable native-bed resuspension. Check integrated fluxes against repeated terrain and dry-solid storage observations, presenting environmental exposure separately from the numerical fraction retained during the selected period.","failure":"注意干擾：少量流失若集中在敏感時段仍可能重要，漏掉旁通排水會使截留率虛高。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A small exported fraction can matter during sensitive periods, and omitted bypass outlets inflate retention. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"同步量入料與回流水濃度流量，確認排水口是否全部納入，並扣除可辨識的原床再懸浮。用分期地形和乾固體存量核對積分收支，將環境暴露與截留率分開呈現。","textEn":"Measure input and all return outlets synchronously and account for identifiable native-bed resuspension. Check integrated fluxes against repeated terrain and dry-solid storage observations, presenting environmental exposure separately from the numerical fraction retained during the selected period.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"同步量入料與回流水濃度流量，確認排水口是否全部納入，並扣除可辨識的原床再懸浮。用分期地形和乾固體存量核對積分收支，將環境暴露與截留率分開呈現。","textEn":"Measure input and all return outlets synchronously and account for identifiable native-bed resuspension. Check integrated fluxes against repeated terrain and dry-solid storage observations, presenting environmental exposure separately from the numerical fraction retained during the selected period.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「回流水固體平衡」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Return-water solids balance\"?","options":["同步量入料與回流水濃度流量，確認排水口是否全部納入，並扣除可辨識的原床再懸浮。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","測深標準不確定度很小就表示所有航道障礙物都被找到。"],"optionsEn":["Measure input and all return outlets synchronously and account for identifiable native-bed resuspension.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Small sounding uncertainty proves that every channel obstruction has been detected."],"answer":0,"explanation":"同步量入料與回流水濃度流量，確認排水口是否全部納入，並扣除可辨識的原床再懸浮。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure input and all return outlets synchronously and account for identifiable native-bed resuspension. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b287-v15-40","title":"回流水固體平衡：失效診斷","titleEn":"Return-water solids balance: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"prerequisiteIds":["b287-v15-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「回流水固體平衡」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Return-water solids balance” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"少量流失若集中在敏感時段仍可能重要，漏掉旁通排水會使截留率虛高。存量變化不符時只改濃度平均值，會掩蓋未量到的出口或暫存延遲。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A small exported fraction can matter during sensitive periods, and omitted bypass outlets inflate retention. Adjusting mean concentration to close a storage discrepancy conceals unmeasured paths or delays instead of explaining the actual material balance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設乾固體輸入100kg/s、回流水2m³/s且固體0.5kg/m³，輸出1kg/s，當期截留率99%；不代表水質合格。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Export is1kg/s and period retention99%, not water-quality compliance.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「九成九固體截留率可以自動證明回流水符合所有環境要求。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Ninety-nine-percent solid retention automatically proves that return water meets every environmental requirement.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b287-v15-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"少量流失若集中在敏感時段仍可能重要，漏掉旁通排水會使截留率虛高。存量變化不符時只改濃度平均值，會掩蓋未量到的出口或暫存延遲。","textEn":"A small exported fraction can matter during sensitive periods, and omitted bypass outlets inflate retention. Adjusting mean concentration to close a storage discrepancy conceals unmeasured paths or delays instead of explaining the actual material balance.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]},{"id":"b287-v15-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「回流水固體平衡」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Return-water solids balance\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","少量流失若集中在敏感時段仍可能重要，漏掉旁通排水會使截留率虛高。","航道平均深度達標就代表每個局部淺點都已移除。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","A small exported fraction can matter during sensitive periods, and omitted bypass outlets inflate retention.","Meeting average channel depth proves that every local controlling shoal has been removed."],"answer":1,"explanation":"少量流失若集中在敏感時段仍可能重要，漏掉旁通排水會使截留率虛高。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A small exported fraction can matter during sensitive periods, and omitted bypass outlets inflate retention. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v15s-dredge","v15s-iho44","v15s-savannah","v15s-poplar","v15s-itm"],"curriculumVersion":15,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
